---
// The "opens another site" arrow on buttons. Drawn, not typed: ↗ has no glyph
// in the display font, so phones fell back to an emoji or a thin, low arrow.
// It inherits the text color and sizes with the button's font.
---
<svg class="out-arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 9.5 9 3M4 2.5h5.5V8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="square" /></svg>
